      "writtenOn": "2026-04-15T06:20:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch. The RAPT devices were being enabled but not exclusively claimed, which could cause Android\u0027s InputReader to also process them. Added EVIOCGRAB in touch_forward to exclusively grab the RAPT device after opening it, preventing duplicate events. The touch_enable script only enables *RAPT*\n  devices (hazelred sidecar endpoints) — the built-in Raydium digitizer is unaffected. See updated patchset.",
      "parentUuid": "82af1501_c376281c",
      "revId": "12dda4f0b96ed106f368b3a720801defc53cb45e",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
